Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Npromise, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Out on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place I want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The last of the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Off we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow of the Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Sharks of Merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro and I will take care of\Nthe mission, so don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I said I'd do this on my own, but\Nit looks like I'll be borrowing Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Infiltration is somewhat of\Na specialty of mine, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find that horny\Ncliff in a spooky fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After we meet up with Sanji and Pudding,\Nwe'll wait here for you to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Things might get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That message from Peckham\Nstill troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but we kept going\Nanyway, so no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun storming the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Depth, 15 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Visibility, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we follow the river, we'll make\Nit straight to Big Mom's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the waters stay deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, you can't stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell an adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just find Sanji,\Nthen wait on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji! Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the enemy's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Sanji was just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure? Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he ran away, because I didn't\Nsee him when I looked a second later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we've got to eat the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's whipped cream only hard! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes like meringue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So this island is all candy, too? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji was standing right\Nup here with Pudding, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I looked away for just a\Nsecond, and then they were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is definitely the coast\Nwhere Pudding told us to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you wouldn't lie about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know why they would\Nrun off as soon as they spotted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so excited to see him, but now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Saji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Saji! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was, but he ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's playing a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But this place sure looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a forest of candies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells good, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If all three of them saw him,\Nthen he must be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would he run to the\Nforest without saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you all to know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant to hide anything\Nfrom my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:07:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to pick you up! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's split up and search!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going for the cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're searching by the cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight, straight to where\Nthat awesome-looking caramel is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to the jelly beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like a good\Nplace for Sanji, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get lost again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have gone that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, what else are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking like people who are\Nabout to get lost in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems you're motivated by something\Nother than your desire to find Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:09:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise. You're awful liars, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's all search together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have snacks, but you can't\Nwander off on your own. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I could smell this\Ncaramel from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It really sticks to your\Nteeth, but it's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Sanji, our Gourmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the one we're here to rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep stopping to munch\Non the forest every two seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we're never gonna get anything done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's awesome desserts everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in enemy territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:10:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Food or not, it's no time for a picnic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's search a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we don't find Sanji soon, then\Nwe're all headed back to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The river is smelling juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you, Tia, notice the\Nbridge is a giant donut?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. Just humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We are good enough for you to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The issue here is that we've got\Na talking crocodile wearing a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this place was dangerous and weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've got talking\Nanimals with hats right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't led us wrong so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wait by the coast,\Nshe'll bring Sanji to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only going to get harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The river's not all that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can jump it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why is there another Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy, you big creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Two Luffies?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They move and talk exactly the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, look, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's Luffy's mirror image.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His scar is backwards, and his accessories\Nand stuff are on the opposite side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like there's\Nan invisible mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you better answer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, up in the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys gotta follow Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the path and do not get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest is dangerous, so if it starts\Nto get weird, turn back and get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to be careful, but I'm\Nworried we might lose Sanji again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, go with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you\Nafter I kick this guy's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running away from your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, tell me, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it! I'm so sick of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a giant buried in the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you OK, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're buried in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you quit messing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I am just trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'd like some juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take him seriously, Chopper, or\Nyou'll end up just as crazy as he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He has something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, my favorite\Nis apple juice. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn left there, you'll\Nfind some apple juice waterfalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose sight of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just here to rescue Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is like a fever dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking for someone, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He came this way just a\Nsecond ago. What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I told you, we got to ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you all about what\Nhappened if you bring me some juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, Chopper, watch out! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, we should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Screaming trees, talking crocodiles,\Nsome kind of murder, rabbit. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,had enough this place is too creepy\Nwe know the way back to Luffy let's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go before we get lost. Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,he was a fake we don't know when we
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,saw him he just sat there in the tree\Nstaring he never said a word to us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah besides if that was the real sanji do\Nyou think he'd keep running away and put
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,us through this mess let's go back you're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,right what the heck
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the clock too it's weird
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose, choose, choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Plop the path and let them wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to play a murder game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, chopper, let's pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my max speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the rabbit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's coming after us fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make it back to\NLuffy, then escape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That rabbit is crazy strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a meek like me, though\Nhe's not then a Devil Fruit maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally the Straw Hats know\Nthere is nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they know we block their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Still they run in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When will they give up this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be long now Soon they will be\Nher prey Falling right into our trap Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel will be pleased Pay the prize
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They would make a snack that's so so nice
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't use Electro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful! Stay with us! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr. Bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His lance! Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind Big Mom's castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole cake shit. There lies a\Nbody of water called Lake Aprico.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Germa ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Permission to enter port.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:21:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You may proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the fleets of Big Mom's associates,\Nor those soon to join her empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,are permitted entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit further. Almost there all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,right that's enough brace for impact
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa, the name of the world's only\Nseafaring nation without a land of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It consists of dozens of daunting\Nvessels that travel independently,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But when they lock up,\Ntogether, they form a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.14,0:23:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This nautical empire is\Nruled by the Vinsmoke family,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,who once conquered the\NNorth Blue by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Jammah Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Their military force, Jammah 666,\Nis feared by people far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly all of its inhabitants\Nare male soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Its citizens train relentlessly every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.48,0:23:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how long do you\Nplan on sitting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:24:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be happy to\Nsee your long-lost sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.74,0:24:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut my ties with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not repeat myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing in common with someone\Nwho'd own tasteless art like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a celebration of our triumph\Nover the kings in North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.78,0:24:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.84,0:24:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it's father's dream to\Nreign over the North
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.12,0:24:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue in the name of Germa as he once did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.74,0:24:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny. I think that it's natural\Nfor men to be drawn to power and glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not take advantage of\Nyour royal blood and seize the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,day rather than playing pirate\Nwith your silly friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.32,0:25:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.50,0:25:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now would you talk that way to these\Nhandmaids awaiting your beckon call?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.82,0:25:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How may we serve young master?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.86,0:25:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No friggin way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why fight your bloodline, dear brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,War is profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.36,0:25:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our business grants us a life of luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.14,0:25:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the minions handle combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.22,0:25:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that not sound appealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We Vinsmokes have earned that right,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.20,0:25:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,through the sheer power\Nof our military science.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have that blood in your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.74,0:25:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.94,0:25:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding is a fine woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite fond of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you headed, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.88,0:26:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.50,0:26:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still in here, sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.54,0:26:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.78,0:26:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have a father, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.84,0:26:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you roughed up Yonji a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.26,0:26:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a surprise, since\Nhe's rather strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes me even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:26:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you meet me outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.62,0:27:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A real man will let his\Nfists do the talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.14,0:27:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.20,0:27:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something going on? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy sure makes a\Nhandy landmark, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.65,0:27:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you bring me some juice or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.70,0:27:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The build of lollipops!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.74,0:27:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we go through here, we'll\Nmake it back to Luffy easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.48,0:27:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.76,0:27:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.94,0:27:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.54,0:28:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.78,0:28:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.32,0:28:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complicated!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is full of traps! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.02,0:28:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.34,0:28:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a weird rabbit trying to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the river where we\Nsaw the talking crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.60,0:28:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the exit should be\Non the other side of the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.24,0:28:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I hope you've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.42,0:28:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.84,0:28:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.62,0:28:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the real me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.82,0:28:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.14,0:28:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.42,0:28:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be a straight\Nshot! Almost there! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.66,0:28:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.50,0:29:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he ran away from us without\Na word and he didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.74,0:29:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it looks like Sanji,\Nbut something's fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.38,0:29:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.66,0:29:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can figure that out after\Nwe make it back to the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.58,0:29:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.49,0:29:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be in the clear any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.32,0:29:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.60,0:29:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.72,0:29:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.18,0:29:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.66,0:29:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.45,0:29:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.22,0:29:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemies this time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.70,0:29:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, I've got this\Nthing stuck in my head. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.80,0:29:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow we just ended up going\Naround in a big circle. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.86,0:29:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you move here just to get in our way?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Don't yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It startles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.84,0:29:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you mean, did I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh, kind of stuck\Nin the ground over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.26,0:29:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys left, and then you\Ncame running right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.16,0:30:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kind of weird, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.66,0:30:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.90,0:30:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.54,0:30:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you pull this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.14,0:30:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross the field of lollipops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.26,0:30:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,over the
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,river of juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is right, it must be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.18,0:30:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.09,0:30:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.36,0:30:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.20,0:30:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.72,0:30:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose is still going\Nnuts, but we shouldn't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.20,0:30:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a clear path back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.28,0:30:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we get turned around?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's straight back this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.16,0:30:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.98,0:31:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.78,0:31:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.69,0:31:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The trees and flowers can move?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.08,0:31:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, three... The cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.72,0:31:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crawling and talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.98,0:31:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.54,0:31:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest can move?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.28,0:31:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.08,0:31:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, they found out! Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.58,0:31:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If it all moves, there's\Nno path we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you finally figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.22,0:31:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This forest is a living nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.92,0:31:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We call this place the Seducing Woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.02,0:31:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.28,0:31:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Luffy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.70,0:31:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.78,0:31:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.34,0:32:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but we've been\Ntogether this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.46,0:32:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And together we'll stay, because\Nyou'll never escape this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.10,0:32:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps in a coffin, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.62,0:32:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobby, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all calm down, little Missy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.82,0:32:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.28,0:32:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You really must see my old scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.42,0:32:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite ghastly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.60,0:32:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you, Tia, a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.20,0:32:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.10,0:32:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a damn tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A cute rabbit and a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.22,0:32:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a charming little bunch you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When I see such bright and beautiful\Nfaces, why, I can hardly help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.92,0:32:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to dig right in\Nand scratch them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.42,0:32:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.33,0:33:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, ah!
